<https://linked.data.gov.au/def/tern-cv/dd34fc05-012d-4092-9324-a4cbcf29bf0a>
    a skos:Concept ;
    dcterms:created "2021-02-01"^^xsd:date ;
    dcterms:modified "2025-12-16"^^xsd:date ;
    dcterms:source "Laws M, McCallum K, Bignall J, Kilpatrick E, O’Neill S, Sparrow B. (2024) Basal Area Module. In ‘Ecological Field Monitoring Protocols Manual using the Ecological Monitoring System Australia’. (Eds S O’Neill, K Irvine, A Tokmakoff, B Sparrow). TERN, Adelaide." ;
